        "meeting_id": "TS3007a",
        "text": "So not a not a remote control who uh uh which can uh can be used for television and a D_V_D_ and radio",
        "participant": "MTD025PM",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3007a.A.dialog-act.vkaraisk.258",
        "meeting_id": "TS3007a",
        "text": "and <disfmarker> Or just only <disfmarker>",
